    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/563de301bdcef6d11760d73e2c592943.avif?t=1618249006\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BUCKLE UP FOR SEASON 2!</h2><br>DROP.  DRIVE.  DESTROY.  <i>notmycar</i> is a white-knuckle, lead-footed multiplayer vehicular combat battle royale.  Drop into a massive battleground for heart-racing action and destruction.  Join  drivers around the world in vehicular combat.  Drive a growing roster of powerful vehicle classes, each with their own performance based on speed, health, and armor.  Face off using cool weapons and abilities to outlast the competition.  Customize your ride with over 300 vehicle skins, flags, drones, and horns.  Play for free and earn your spot as the last car standing in the fastest Battle Royale ever!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/03196de7e706cf72ce6eca13ffaefd14.avif?t=1618249006\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/96121618f5ea116ce6d2af41fc03ddb6.poster.avif?t=1618249006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/96121618f5ea116ce6d2af41fc03ddb6.webm?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/96121618f5ea116ce6d2af41fc03ddb6.mp4?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Put the pedal to the metal and keep your finger on the trigger.  Battle Royale means second place is the first loser, so show no mercy for anyone on four wheels.   Send your opponents to the junkyard in the ultimate battle to be the last car standing!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/a7d03717a9ce47abf16ee0125bf1a47a.avif?t=1618249006\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/830f6715175fd5ffb64e33c81c9ec1e3.poster.avif?t=1618249006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/830f6715175fd5ffb64e33c81c9ec1e3.webm?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/830f6715175fd5ffb64e33c81c9ec1e3.mp4?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Match your playing style with a growing roster of powerful vehicle classes, each with their own performance. Choose from the Mantis, Asp, Beast, or Ligar based on Health, Armor, Braking, Drifting, and Acceleration.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/079f86e8618042cf31655dc18748fa84.avif?t=1618249006\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/61cf264fff4d9e146b6bb3c1b8165bbf.poster.avif?t=1618249006\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/61cf264fff4d9e146b6bb3c1b8165bbf.webm?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/694720/extras/61cf264fff4d9e146b6bb3c1b8165bbf.mp4?t=1618249006\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Pick the best landing zones to collect the best weapons and abilities on a massive island battleground that shrinks by the minute. Battle your way through single-elimination combat, driving your enemies right into your sights.<br><br><di